    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Target</strong> One creature with which you have linked your mind</p>\n<hr />\n<p> </p>\n<p>You are in sync with your companions' mental state and can calm their minds to boost their focus when they need it most. When you use this action, it counts as a preparation to help for the @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.HCl3pzVefiv9ZKQW]{Aid} reaction. You may use your diplomacy or occultism to encourage your ally for the aid bonus. No matter the result, the target then becomes immune to Thoughtsinger for 1 hour. </p>"
    },
